<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 38, background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模块一 · 反向 RAG 检索（张瑞桐）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#06B6D4', marginLeft: 12, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>把 LLM 关进标准条款的笼子</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '47%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #06B6D4' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位：先<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>检索相关规范条款</span>，再据此判定——而非让模型自由编。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>_TfidfIndex</span>：基于风险点语料构建 IDF，query 用 TF-IDF 向量 + 余弦相似度排序。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>同义/近义识别</span>：向量空间里近义词距离近，「稀释溶液」与「往试管加水」可命中同一条款。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>全局缓存</span>：进程级 _tfidf_index，避免每次请求重建索引。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 召回不到 → 退化为「基于通用安全常识判断」，不会硬编。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '53%', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <svg width='540' height='210' viewBox='0 0 540 210'>
        <defs>
          <marker id='ar10' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='7' refY='3' orient='auto'>
            <path d='M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' />
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <rect x='8' y='40' width='110' height='62' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#475569' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='63' y='66' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>行为文本</text>
        <text x='63' y='86' textAnchor='middle' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12'>_tokenize</text>
        <rect x='140' y='40' width='110' height='62' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='195' y='66' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>TF-IDF</text>
        <text x='195' y='86' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>向量化</text>
        <rect x='272' y='40' width='120' height='62' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='332' y='66' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>余弦相似度</text>
        <text x='332' y='86' textAnchor='middle' fill='#67E8F9' fontSize='12'>排序</text>
        <rect x='414' y='40' width='118' height='62' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='473' y='66' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>Top-3</text>
        <text x='473' y='86' textAnchor='middle' fill='#C4B5FD' fontSize='12'>风险条款</text>
        <line x1='118' y1='71' x2='140' y2='71' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar10)' />
        <line x1='250' y1='71' x2='272' y2='71' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar10)' />
        <line x1='392' y1='71' x2='414' y2='71' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar10)' />
      </svg>
      <Box style={{ width: '100%', padding: '14px 18px', background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.08)', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px dashed rgba(6,182,212,0.4)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>同义识别示例：「稀释溶液」与「往试管里加水」在向量空间距离近，都能命中同一条规范条款——<span style={{ color:'#67E8F9' }}>表达不同，规矩一致</span>。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 18px', background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(6,182,212,0.16), rgba(59,130,246,0.05))', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.35)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>答辩亮点</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>用检索约束生成：AI 说的每句话，都能追溯到具体条款——先有「标准」，再谈「解释」。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>实战避错系统 · 团队分工</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>10 / 25</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
